          "text": "VAN_DER_POL_MU1_EULER\nx'' = 1*(1-x*x)*v - x; x(0) = 0.1, 2, 4; v(0) = 0.\nRun 40 model seconds at 1000 Hz. Double-click Scope and phase viewers.\nEquations, experiments and numerical limits: examples/van_der_pol/README.md.\nState at step k represents (k-1)*dt; observation label is k*dt.\nExperimental teaching model; manual Studio workflow remains unqualified.",
